> I am writing to express my enthusiastic interest in the Chief Development Officer position for the Hire Human initiative at LaunchCode. With over two decades of experience in sustainability leadership and fundraising for mission-driven organizations, I am excited about the opportunity to leverage my skills and network to scale LaunchCode's AI upskilling and job placement initiative nationally. My focus on relationship management, project organization, and strategic growth aligns closely with the goals of this role, and I am eager to contribute to LaunchCode's innovative and impactful mission.
> 
> Throughout my career, I have consistently demonstrated my ability to lead and expand development functions in lean, dynamic environments. At the Institute for Market Transformation, I successfully established and executed a new individual giving strategy which raised over $50,000 in new gifts. My experience with major giving has enabled me to build and close personal portfolios of significant donor and institutional relationships, including at the Clean Energy Buyers Association, where I scaled the membership network to include over 450 corporate participants.
> 
> I possess a deep network of existing funders and donors, which I am prepared to activate from day one at LaunchCode. My proficiency in grant writing and donor relationship management is complemented by strong communication skills, honed through years of crafting messages accessible to diverse audiences and creating successful communication strategies. As a passionate advocate for education and workforce development, I am particularly inspired by LaunchCode’s mission to democratize tech education and create new pathways for aspiring technologists from all backgrounds.
> 
> Some of my proudest achievements include curating revenue-generating events and collaborating with stakeholders to build strategies for complex initiatives. These experiences, along with my leadership roles at organizations like Sustainable Ventures and The Climate Group, have equipped me with the strategic foresight and practical expertise needed to drive the Hire Human initiative's new national fundraising strategy.
> 
> I am excited about the prospect of leading and growing a team dedicated to scaling LaunchCode’s impact, and I am prepared to travel and engage externally as needed to foster new opportunities for the organization. Thank you for considering my application. I would be thrilled to discuss with you how my experience and vision align with LaunchCode’s future direction.
> 
> Warmest regards,
> 
> Johanna N. Goetzel  
