> 
> I am particularly drawn to GoodPower’s mission to create meaningful change in the energy transition landscape. As a proactive advocate for sustainability, I am enthusiastic about the opportunity to represent GoodPower at external events and industry conferences, spreading our vision with professionalism and passion.
